  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Constructing CetakLaporan Component**\n\nI\'m now focusing on building the `/src/components/CetakLaporan.tsx` component. My priority is high-quality, print-ready CSS. I\'m starting by designing a filter panel, which will include fields for Start Date, End Date, and Class selection. This component will then display two nicely formatted tables: \"Rekapitulasi Presensi Murid\".\n\n\n**Defining Student Presence Metrics**\n\nI\'m now zeroing in on defining the student presence metrics. My aim is to deliver a fully customizable and robust calculation for Presence %. I\'ve decided to implement the calculation as `Hadir / TotalDays * 100`. The component will then show a comprehensive table listing all students with their attendance breakdown: Hadir, Izin, Sakit, Alpa, and the calculated Presence %.\n\n\n"
