    modified_response: "I have applied the **Professional Polish** design theme to the SIAKAD V1 application, introducing high-fidelity layout patterns and color aesthetics from the design specification while preserving all existing component functions and interactions:\n\n- **Integrated Left Sidebar Navigation (Desktop)**: Configured a deep emerald (`bg-emerald-900`) left-side panel featuring an active tab layout (`border-l-4 border-emerald-400 bg-emerald-800`), professional branding elements with a dedicated **MI** logo box, and the system footer watermark.\n- **Top Breadcrumbs & Profile Headers**: Replaced the previous horizontal top-navigation with an elegant breadcrumbs path (`Dashboard / [Active Tab]`), an administrative profile chip with initials, user role captions, and modern logout functionality.\n- **Responsive Adaptability**: Maintained the optimized mobile top banner and expandable navigation drawer on smaller viewports (`md:hidden`) for a fully seamless cross-device experience.\n- **Color Accent Consistency**: Wrapped all cards, tables, status indicators, and buttons in a clean off-white canvas with precise slate borders and rich emerald details."
